    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693410/extras/0a67f41b010859089faa545b745aac53.avif?t=1750700329\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br>New college, new life! As Shun Kousaka moves to another town, a new chapter in his life begins. Filled with ambitions, he sets out to finally find himself a girlfriend. His dream becomes true as he meets the president of the tennis club: Mahiru Haruno. It\u2019s love at first sight, and he immediately joins the club to spend more time with her.<br><br>If Shun\u2019s dream comes true depends on the decisions he makes throughout the story. Will the two become a happy couple? Find out, in \u201cThe Reason for your Smile\u201d!<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693410/extras/74288d4075d86bb59c5b177e9387f21d.avif?t=1750700329\" width=617 height=72 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693410/extras/4ad90c3794f35def36ae2d8cd43ba919.avif?t=1750700329\" width=617 height=426 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693410/extras/93ca21df21868a80af85efa21092525f.avif?t=1750700329\" width=617 height=426 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693410/extras/87c75ed0c291eb8d7dcc77f420d5395b.avif?t=1750700329\" width=617 height=329 /></span>",
